<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
    xmlns:ev="http://www.w3.org/2001/xml-events"
    xmlns:w2="http://www.inswave.com/websquare" xmlns:xf="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms">
    <head>
        <w2:type>COMPONENT</w2:type>
        <w2:buildDate/>
        <w2:MSA/>
        <xf:model>
            <w2:dataCollection baseNode="map"/>
            <w2:workflowCollection/>
        </xf:model>
        <w2:layoutInfo/>
        <w2:publicInfo method=""/>
        <script lazy="false" type="text/javascript"><![CDATA[
scwin.onpageload = function () {

};

scwin.trigger1_onclick = function (e) {
    input1.setMaxByteLength(-1);
};
]]></script>
    </head>
    <body ev:onpageload="scwin.onpageload">
    <xf:group id="" style="margin: 10px;">
    	<w2:textbox style="color: blue;margin-bottom: 10px;" id="textbox1" label="최대 입력 가능 바이트 길이 설정 및 초기화" escape="false" tagname="h1">
    	</w2:textbox>
    	<w2:textbox tagname="h2" style="height: 23px;margin-bottom: 10px;color: blue;" id="textbox4" label="샘플 사용 방법"></w2:textbox>
    	<w2:textbox style="color: blue;margin-bottom: 30px;" id="textbox2"
    		label='1. maxByteLength="5" 설정에 따라, 5 바이트 길이의 텍스트만 입력할 수 있는 것을 확인. &lt;br/&gt;2. setMaxByteLength(-1) 버튼을 클릭하여 maxByteLength 속성 값을 초기화.&lt;br/&gt;3. 5 바이트 이상의 텍스트를 입력할 수 있는 것을 확인.'
    		escape="false">
    	</w2:textbox>
    	<w2:textbox
    		style="padding:5px;text-align:left;font-size: 15px;font-weight:bolder;background-color: lightblue;border:none;margin-bottom: 10px;"
    		id="textbox3" label='속성 설정&lt;br/&gt;maxByteLength="5"' escape="false">
    	</w2:textbox>
    	<xf:trigger ev:onclick="scwin.trigger1_onclick"
    		style="display: block;height:42px;line-height:32px;padding:5px;background-color:coral;font-size:15px;weight: bolder;font-weight:bolder;margin-bottom:10px;text-align: left;"
    		id="trigger1" type="button">
    		<xf:label><![CDATA[input1.setMaxByteLength(-1);]]></xf:label>
    	</xf:trigger>
    	<xf:input
    		style="width: 100%;text-align: right;height:50px;padding: 5px;font-size:30px;font-style:normal;font-weight:bolder;color: red;"
    		id="input1" maxByteLength="5">
    	</xf:input>
    </xf:group></body>
</html>
